<title>USA: TABLE - Delta Financial sells $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Delta Financial sells $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Delta Financial Corp was priced Friday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>Delta Financial is a Woodbury, N.Y.-based specialty consumer finance company engaged in originating, acquiring, selling and servicing non-conforming home equity loans..</p>
<p>BORROWER DELTA FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.517  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD  9.595 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD +337.5 BPS CALLABLE  NON-CALL FOUR</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
